1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,446
Ye nau laddoo dekho. Ek mein double khoya hai. Sirf do baar taulkar bata sakte ho, kaun sa?

2
00:00:05,536 --> 00:00:10,488
Chanda ne mithai ka dibba khola. Sab ek jaise dikhte hain, par ek laddoo bhaari hai.

3
00:00:10,598 --> 00:00:13,205
Aman, taraazu le aao. Bas do baar taulna hai!

4
00:00:13,345 --> 00:00:18,776
Pehli chaal tumhari! Ek ke saamne ek? Teen ke saamne teen? Ya chaar ke saamne chaar?

5
00:00:19,776 --> 00:00:22,528
Teen idhar, teen udhar. Baaki teen bahar rakho.

6
00:00:22,648 --> 00:00:26,928
Arre! Dono palde barabar! Toh bhaari laddoo kahaan hai? Bahar waale teen mein!

7
00:00:27,048 --> 00:00:30,204
Aakhri chaal! Saat aur aath ko taulo. Nau ko wahin chhod do.

8
00:00:30,334 --> 00:00:32,974
Phir barabar! Ab bolo, double khoya kismein hai?

9
00:00:33,824 --> 00:00:37,109
Nau number mein! Saat aur aath barabar. Bacha kaun? Sirf nau!

10
00:00:37,229 --> 00:00:40,603
Aur maza dekho! Jis laddoo ko pakda, use taula hi nahin!
